Wi-Fi firmware in Devs/Firmware, and the licence each file is under.

The files are third_party/wifipi/firmware, unchanged.  All but one are
byte-identical to Raspberry Pi OS firmware-nonfree (RPi-Distro, branch
trixie, debian/added-firmware/brcm and .../cypress); the licences follow
that package's debian/copyright:

  debian/added-firmware/*/*43430*   Cypress Semiconductor   LICENCE.cypress
  debian/added-firmware/*/*43455*   Cypress Semiconductor   LICENCE.cypress
  debian/added-firmware/*/*43436*   Synaptics               LICENCE.synaptics
  debian/added-firmware/*/*43456*   Synaptics               LICENCE.synaptics

  File                          Licence
  brcmfmac43430-sdio.txt        LICENCE.cypress
  cyfmac43430-sdio.bin          LICENCE.cypress
  cyfmac43430-sdio.clm_blob     LICENCE.cypress
  brcmfmac43455-sdio.txt        LICENCE.cypress
  cyfmac43455-sdio.bin          LICENCE.cypress (a Cypress 43455 build
                                not in firmware-nonfree's trixie branch)
  cyfmac43455-sdio.clm_blob     LICENCE.cypress
  brcmfmac43436-sdio.bin        LICENCE.synaptics
  brcmfmac43436-sdio.clm_blob   LICENCE.synaptics
  brcmfmac43436-sdio.txt        LICENCE.synaptics
  brcmfmac43436s-sdio.bin       LICENCE.synaptics
  brcmfmac43436s-sdio.txt       LICENCE.synaptics
  brcmfmac43456-sdio.bin        LICENCE.synaptics
  brcmfmac43456-sdio.clm_blob   LICENCE.synaptics
  brcmfmac43456-sdio.txt        LICENCE.synaptics

LICENCE.cypress is linux-firmware's LICENSES/LICENCE.cypress (commit
1221848f23764faab10ff63bc5d9ea5d5b39a506).  LICENCE.synaptics is the
"License: Synaptics" text of firmware-nonfree's debian/copyright.
